      "statement": "Every file transfer is encrypted with a per-file AES-128-GCM key (128-bit key, 12-byte random IV, key usage encrypt/decrypt) generated by generateAesKey; when encryption is enabled the sender wraps that key and places the wrapped key in FileMetadata.key, and chunks are only encrypted when isEncrypt is set.",
